      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article reports a case of retrieval of an ectopic molar medial to the coronoid process of the mandible that caused chronic discharging of a sinus into the mouth and recurrent facial swelling. Possible origin of the tooth and surgical approaches are discussed."},
